        "Present: The dominant card game in Punjab and Gujarat, often played with spectators betting on the 'Kot' (Slam).",
      ],
      evolution: "The name 'Be-Ranga' implies 'No Trump', referring to a variation where the trump is revealed later, but the core 'Double Sar' mechanic is what defines the modern game.",
      cultural: "Winning a 'Kot' (taking all 13 tricks) is considered a massive humiliation for the losing team, often resulting in them dealing the next hand (a sign of subservience).",
